Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, pkexec | policykit-1
Homepage: https://github.com/NevamindHaze/vivobook-fan-control
Description: Auto and Full fan switch for the ASUS VivoBook X412DA
 A small window showing CPU temperature and fan RPM, with an immediate
 switch between Auto and Full. The fan returns to Auto when the app closes.
